    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d496">

                <pb facs="0570" n="466" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg466"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 839.51/967.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Chargé
                            d’Affaires to the Secretary of
                        State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Santo Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-03-06">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 6, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The Minister exchanged notes with the Minister for Foreign Affairs on March 1 and
                    has taken an original of the loan contract to you. Claims are being presented
                    for payment, as the matter is considered to be settled.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Curtis</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
